# UI8Kit primitives — Svelte 5

Primitives live in `src/ui` (one folder per primitive, generated code: do not edit by hand).
Import them from there: `import Box from "$ui/box/Box.svelte"` (or `src/ui/...`).

## 1. Use a primitive instead of raw HTML

Where a primitive exists for an element, use the primitive, never the raw tag:

| Primitive | Renders |
| --- | --- |
| Box | structural tags via `tag` (default `div`) |
| Text | text tags via `tag` (default `p`) |
| Button | `button` or `a` when `href` is set |
| Icon | `span[data-slot=icon]`; Lucide glyph as child |
| Input | `input` |
| Textarea | `textarea` |
| Form | `form` |
| Label | `label` |
| Link | `a` |
| Separator | `hr` |

Raw HTML is fine only for elements no primitive covers, and only inside the kit zone.

## 2. `tag` accepts only real HTML5 tags

`Box` and `Text` choose their element with `tag`. Pass only a real HTML5 tag from the allowed list
(never a component name, custom element or made-up tag). `Title` uses `as` 1..6.

## 3. Static ARIA via props

Set ARIA through the primitive's typed props as static values.
Do not hand-write `role`/`aria-*` that a primitive already renders.

## 4. Colors only via shadcn token classes

`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, …
No palette colors, no hex/rgb/hsl values, no inline `style` colors.

## 5. Icons: Lucide inside `Icon`

Use Lucide icons (`@lucide/svelte`) as the child of `Icon`; size via `Icon` `size`.
Give `label` when the icon carries meaning and the parent has no accessible name.
